[AEVUM OS PACKAGED DISTRIBUTION]
This is a dummy installation package for Aevum OS (Desktop client and MCP server).
In production, this zip contains:
1. aevum.exe (Windows executable) / aevum (macOS/Linux)
2. package.json and node_modules pre-bundled
3. install.bat / install.sh setups
4. .aevum/ global configurations
